  "details": "I'm positive that I am not the only one that has run into this issue. The problem has to do with the avatars loading. Right before the avatar fully loads and shows up, the person it is loading for will lag out heavily, be it the person who put on the avatar or someone waiting for it to load. It doesn't matter if the avatar is in your cache or not when this happens. Please fix this issue.",
